      <p begin="00:23.510" end="00:28.550"><span begin="00:23.510" end="00:24.205">That</span> <span begin="00:24.205" end="00:25.769">snowflake</span> <span begin="00:25.769" end="00:26.464">once</span> <span begin="00:26.464" end="00:27.160">fell</span> <span begin="00:27.160" end="00:27.507">on</span> <span begin="00:27.507" end="00:27.855">my</span> <span begin="00:27.855" end="00:28.550">nose</span></p>
