      <p begin="00:39.780" end="00:46.260"><span begin="00:39.780" end="00:40.407">The</span> <span begin="00:40.407" end="00:41.661">moment</span> <span begin="00:41.661" end="00:41.870">I</span> <span begin="00:41.870" end="00:43.125">softly</span> <span begin="00:43.125" end="00:43.752">let</span> <span begin="00:43.752" end="00:44.170">go</span> <span begin="00:44.170" end="00:44.588">of</span> <span begin="00:44.588" end="00:45.424">your</span> <span begin="00:45.424" end="00:46.260">hand</span></p>
      <p begin="00:46.260" end="00:51.380"><span begin="00:46.260" end="00:46.991">Winds</span> <span begin="00:46.991" end="00:47.430">hum</span> <span begin="00:47.430" end="00:48.454">through</span> <span begin="00:48.454" end="00:48.893">the</span> <span begin="00:48.893" end="00:50.210">trembling</span> <span begin="00:50.210" end="00:51.380">branches</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.380" end="00:54.840"><span begin="00:51.380" end="00:51.513">A</span> <span begin="00:51.513" end="00:52.045">song</span> <span begin="00:52.045" end="00:52.445">for</span> <span begin="00:52.445" end="00:52.578">a</span> <span begin="00:52.578" end="00:53.110">soul</span> <span begin="00:53.110" end="00:53.775">bound</span> <span begin="00:53.775" end="00:54.042">to</span> <span begin="00:54.042" end="00:54.574">soar</span> <span begin="00:54.574" end="00:54.840">to</span></p>
      <p begin="00:54.840" end="00:58.580"><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.256">The</span> <span begin="00:55.256" end="00:55.810">very</span> <span begin="00:55.810" end="00:56.364">edge</span> <span begin="00:56.364" end="00:56.641">of</span> <span begin="00:56.641" end="00:57.056">the</span> <span begin="00:57.056" end="00:57.887">starry</span> <span begin="00:57.887" end="00:58.580">ocean</span></p>
