      <p begin="01:02.520" end="01:07.850"><span begin="01:02.520" end="01:02.687">I</span> <span begin="01:02.687" end="01:03.353">will</span> <span begin="01:03.353" end="01:04.019">gaze</span> <span begin="01:04.019" end="01:04.352">at</span> <span begin="01:04.352" end="01:05.185">where</span> <span begin="01:05.185" end="01:05.685">you</span> <span begin="01:05.685" end="01:06.184">are</span> <span begin="01:06.184" end="01:06.684">for</span> <span begin="01:06.684" end="01:07.184">all</span> <span begin="01:07.184" end="01:07.850">time</span></p>
