      <p begin="01:43.490" end="01:48.420"><span begin="01:43.490" end="01:44.215">Which</span> <span begin="01:44.215" end="01:44.505">is</span> <span begin="01:44.505" end="01:45.085">sign</span> <span begin="01:45.085" end="01:45.375">of</span> <span begin="01:45.375" end="01:46.245">warmth</span> <span begin="01:46.245" end="01:46.680">and</span> <span begin="01:46.680" end="01:47.260">hope</span> <span begin="01:47.260" end="01:47.550">of</span> <span begin="01:47.550" end="01:48.420">spring</span></p>
      <p begin="01:48.420" end="01:56.620"><span begin="01:48.420" end="01:48.830">So</span> <span begin="01:48.830" end="01:49.650">I'll</span> <span begin="01:49.650" end="01:50.675">dance</span> <span begin="01:50.675" end="01:53.135">flamboyantly</span> <span begin="01:53.135" end="01:53.955">into</span> <span begin="01:53.955" end="01:54.775">that</span> <span begin="01:54.775" end="01:55.595">good</span> <span begin="01:55.595" end="01:56.620">night</span></p>
      <p begin="02:04.840" end="02:07.880"><span begin="02:04.840" end="02:05.853">Bon</span> <span begin="02:05.853" end="02:07.880">voyage</span></p>
