      <p begin="02:34.950" end="02:40.770"><span begin="02:34.950" end="02:35.736">Guess</span> <span begin="02:35.736" end="02:36.366">I'll</span> <span begin="02:36.366" end="02:37.152">spend</span> <span begin="02:37.152" end="02:37.467">my</span> <span begin="02:37.467" end="02:38.253">whole</span> <span begin="02:38.253" end="02:38.882">life</span> <span begin="02:38.882" end="02:40.455">unraveling</span> <span begin="02:40.455" end="02:40.770">it</span></p>
